silero_vad_v6.onnx — vendored third-party model

This file is `faster_whisper/assets/silero_vad_v6.onnx` from the
faster-whisper project, copied verbatim (sha256
4cbf549b8326f60f80f2536d9eefeb450a9abe83365a098031c89719f1be17d2, 1245151
bytes), which is itself an ONNX re-export of the Silero VAD model. It has a
different interface (batched input[seq_len,576]/h/c) than the upstream
snakers4/silero-vad release's own ONNX export (streaming input/state/sr) —
they are not interchangeable. scripts/vad_model.py's wrapper is written
specifically against this file's interface; do not replace it with a
differently-exported Silero VAD file.

