scripts/vad_model.py's inference wrapper is a from-scratch port of the
relevant ~40 lines of faster_whisper/vad.py's SileroVADModel (MIT), with two
fixes: it copies the input audio before scoring (upstream mutates the last 64
samples of the caller's buffer via a view) and it verifies the model file's
sha256 at load time.
